        <briefdescription>
<para>递归地将表达式分解为 (实部, 虚部)，把 <ref refid="df/de2/classLMCAS_1_1ComplexNode" kindref="compound">ComplexNode</ref> 视为 a+bi。 仅处理加法、乘法、数值与 <ref refid="df/de2/classLMCAS_1_1ComplexNode" kindref="compound">ComplexNode</ref> 组合；其余子表达式视为实值。 </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>累乘：(a+bi)(c+di) = (ac-bd) + (ad+bc)i</para>
<para>对整数次幂，展开为重复乘法以分离实/虚部。</para>
<para>(a+bi)^e via repeated complex multiplication</para>
<para>实底数或非整数指数：视为实值</para>
<para>退化情形：原样返回为实部</para>
<para>默认：视为实值表达式</para>
        </inbodydescription>
